* mv_package — MVPKG helper: resolve the registry base URL (UniData port).
* Copyright (C) 2026 Gordon Heydon.  GPL-2.0-only (see LICENSE).
*
* MVPKG.REG(REG) — RESULT REG is the registry base URL, taken from
* $MVPKG_REGISTRY, then the persisted ~/mvpkg.conf, then the built-in
* default.  Shared by every subcommand that talks to the registry.  UniData
* port: GETENV + the statement form of OSREAD.
   SUBROUTINE MVPKG.REG(REG)
   DEFURL = "https://mv-package.heydon.io"
   CONF = GETENV("HOME") : "/mvpkg.conf"
   REG = GETENV("MVPKG_REGISTRY")
   IF REG = "" THEN
      OSREAD REG FROM CONF ELSE REG = ""
      REG = TRIM(REG, CHAR(10), "T")
   END
   IF REG = "" THEN REG = DEFURL
   RETURN
